        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  SECTION 15 — FEATURE HIGHLIGHT\n  Self-contained Custom Liquid. Mobile-optimized, theme-font friendly.\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<style>\n  .noula-feat {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    color: #2D241D;\n    padding: 36px 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid #EAE1D2;\n  }\n\n  .noula-feat * {\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .noula-feat__wrap {\n    max-width: 680px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n  }\n\n  .noula-feat__title {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #2D241D;\n    font-size: clamp(26px, 7vw, 34px);\n    line-height: 1.12;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n\n  .noula-feat__hl {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #E7B4AA;\n    color: #2D241D;\n    padding: 1px 10px 3px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .noula-feat__p {\n    margin: 15px 0 0;\n    color: #4A3D31;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.58;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n\n  .noula-feat__list {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 20px 0 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 13px;\n  }\n\n  .noula-feat__list li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    color: #2D241D;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n\n  .noula-feat__icon {\n    width: 38px;\n    height: 38px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .noula-feat__img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    margin-top: 24px;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (min-width: 641px) {\n    .noula-feat {\n      padding: 46px 0;\n    }\n\n    .noula-feat__wrap {\n      padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    .noula-feat__title {\n      font-size: 34px;\n      line-height: 1.14;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .noula-feat__p {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    .noula-feat__img {\n      margin-top: 26px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"noula-feat\">\n  <div class=\"noula-feat__wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"noula-feat__title\">\n      You&#39;re not <span class=\"noula-feat__hl\">imagining it</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"noula-feat__p\">\n      Women describe it the same way over and over. It happened overnight. I fell off a cliff. I looked in the mirror and didn&#39;t recognise myself.\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"noula-feat__p\">\n      Somewhere between 45 and 53, oestrogen drops and skin changes faster than it ever has. Drier. Thinner. Crepey along the neck and jaw. The routine that worked for twenty years suddenly does nothing. You didn&#39;t do anything wrong. Your skin genuinely changed, and most of what&#39;s on the shelf was never designed for what it changed into.\n    </p>\n\n    <ul class=\"noula-feat__list\">\n      <li>\n        <img\n          class=\"noula-feat__icon\"\n          src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/Frame_33.png?v=1781526850\"\n          alt=\"\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n        >\n        <span>You moisturise and still wake up dry</span>\n      </li>\n\n      <li>\n        <img\n          class=\"noula-feat__icon\"\n          src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/Frame_34.png?v=1781526850\"\n          alt=\"\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n        >\n        <span>Rich creams end up on your pillowcase</span>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <img\n      class=\"noula-feat__img\"\n      src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/model_916_v1.jpg?v=1781526384\"\n      alt=\"Woman applying Noula night cream\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n    >\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
