    "custom_liquid_LbhTjy": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  SECTION 16 — HOW IT WORKS\n  Self-contained Custom Liquid. Mobile-optimized, theme-font friendly.\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<div id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"noula-how\">\n  <div class=\"noula-how__wrap\">\n\n<style>\n  .noula-how {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    color: #2D241D;\n    padding: 36px 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid #EAE1D2;\n  }\n\n  .noula-how * {\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .noula-how__wrap {\n    max-width: 680px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n  }\n\n  .noula-how__title {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #2D241D;\n    font-size: clamp(26px, 7vw, 34px);\n    line-height: 1.12;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n\n  .noula-how__p {\n    margin: 15px 0 0;\n    color: #4A3D31;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.58;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n\n  .noula-how__list {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 20px 0 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 13px;\n  }\n\n  .noula-how__list li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    color: #2D241D;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n\n  .noula-how__icon {\n    width: 38px;\n    height: 38px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (min-width: 641px) {\n    .noula-how {\n      padding: 46px 0;\n    }\n\n    .noula-how__wrap {\n      padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    .noula-how__title {\n      font-size: 34px;\n      line-height: 1.14;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .noula-how__p {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"noula-how\">\n  <div class=\"noula-how__wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"noula-how__title\">How does it work?</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"noula-how__p\">\n      Your skin does most of its repair work while you sleep. After 45 that work slows down. You still sleep. Your skin just doesn&#39;t finish the job.\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"noula-how__p\">\n      A standard moisturiser is water and oil sitting on the surface. It feels good for a few hours and is gone long before morning. That is why you can moisturise every single night and still wake up tight and dry.\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"noula-how__p\">\n      Noula is built for the window itself. Korean red rice extract, ceramides, hyaluronic acid and Vitamin B5 stay with your skin through the night, feeding the barrier instead of stripping it, so by morning your skin feels replenished rather than depleted. No acids. No retinol. Nothing that has to hurt first.\n    </p>\n\n    <ul class=\"noula-how__list\">\n      <li>\n        <img\n          class=\"noula-how__icon\"\n          src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/Frame_11.png?v=1781139084\"\n          alt=\"\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n        >\n        <span>Works in the window your skin already uses</span>\n      </li>\n\n      <li>\n        <img\n          class=\"noula-how__icon\"\n          src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/Frame_8.png?v=1781139084\"\n          alt=\"\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n        >\n        <span>Gentle enough for every night</span>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
