t\"><div class=\"noula-stat__big\">9/10</div><div class=\"noula-stat__txt\"><div class=\"noula-stat__st\">said skin felt softer &amp; smoother</div><div class=\"noula-stat__src\">Based on an 8-week consumer panel</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"noula-stat\"><div class=\"noula-stat__big\">89%</div><div class=\"noula-stat__txt\"><div class=\"noula-stat__st\">would repurchase &amp; recommend</div><div class=\"noula-stat__src\">Based on an 8-week consumer panel</div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
