        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  SECTION 18 — COMPARISON TABLE\n  Self-contained Custom Liquid. Compact mobile table.\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<style>\n  .noula-cmp {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    color: #2D241D;\n    padding: 36px 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid #EAE1D2;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp * {\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__wrap {\n    max-width: 680px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__title {\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #2D241D;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__box {\n    border: 1px solid #EAE1D2;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #FFFDF9;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__box table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__box th,\n  .noula-cmp__box td {\n    padding: 14px 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #EAE1D2;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__box th:first-child,\n  .noula-cmp__box td:first-child {\n    width: 58%;\n    text-align: left;\n    color: #6B5C4F;\n    font-size: 12.8px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__box th:nth-child(2),\n  .noula-cmp__box td:nth-child(2) {\n    width: 21%;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__box th:nth-child(3),\n  .noula-cmp__box td:nth-child(3) {\n    width: 21%;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__box thead th {\n    height: 74px;\n    color: #2D241D;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__box thead th.is-us {\n    padding: 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: #F6E2DC;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__box td.is-us {\n    background: #F6E2DC;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__box tr:last-child td {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__logo {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    display: block;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    object-fit: contain;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__mark {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__mark--yes {\n    filter: invert(40%) sepia(35%) saturate(700%) hue-rotate(56deg) brightness(88%) contrast(90%);\n  }\n\n  .noula-cmp__mark--no {\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    opacity: 0.7;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (min-width: 641px) {\n    .noula-cmp {\n      padding: 46px 0;\n    }\n\n    .noula-cmp__wrap {\n      padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    .noula-cmp__title {\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n      font-size: 26px;\n    }\n\n    .noula-cmp__box th,\n    .noula-cmp__box td {\n      padding: 15px 10px;\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n    }\n\n    .noula-cmp__box th:first-child,\n    .noula-cmp__box td:first-child {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      padding-left: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .noula-cmp__box thead th {\n      height: 78px;\n    }\n\n    .noula-cmp__box thead th.is-us {\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    .noula-cmp__logo {\n      width: 64px;\n      height: 64px;\n    }\n\n    .noula-cmp__mark {\n      width: 20px;\n      height: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .noula-cmp__mark--no {\n      width: 18px;\n      height: 18px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"noula-cmp\">\n  <div class=\"noula-cmp__wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"noula-cmp__title\">Why Noula, not what&#39;s on your shelf</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"noula-cmp__box\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th></th>\n            <th class=\"is-us\">\n              <img\n                class=\"noula-cmp__logo\"\n                src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/Frame_2_1.png?v=1780830581\"\n                alt=\"Noula\"\n                loading=\"lazy\"\n              >\n            </th>\n            <th>Others</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>Made for skin that changed after 45</td>\n            <td class=\"is-us\"><img class=\"noula-cmp__mark noula-cmp__mark--yes\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/check-mark-black-outline.svg?v=1781528042\" alt=\"Yes\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n            <td><img class=\"noula-cmp__mark noula-cmp__mark--no\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/cross-23.png?v=1781528045\" alt=\"No\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr>\n            <td>Works without acids or retinol</td>\n            <td class=\"is-us\"><img class=\"noula-cmp__mark noula-cmp__mark--yes\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/check-mark-black-outline.svg?v=1781528042\" alt=\"Yes\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n            <td><img class=\"noula-cmp__mark noula-cmp__mark--no\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/cross-23.png?v=1781528045\" alt=\"No\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr>\n            <td>Safe on reactive skin, every night</td>\n            <td class=\"is-us\"><img class=\"noula-cmp__mark noula-cmp__mark--yes\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/check-mark-black-outline.svg?v=1781528042\" alt=\"Yes\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n            <td><img class=\"noula-cmp__mark noula-cmp__mark--no\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/cross-23.png?v=1781528045\" alt=\"No\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr>\n            <td>90 nights, keep the jar</td>\n            <td class=\"is-us\"><img class=\"noula-cmp__mark noula-cmp__mark--yes\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/check-mark-black-outline.svg?v=1781528042\" alt=\"Yes\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n            <td><img class=\"noula-cmp__mark noula-cmp__mark--no\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0809/2925/9750/files/cross-23.png?v=1781528045\" alt=\"No\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n          </tr>\n\n                  </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
